{%- comment -%}
  The value of the free Welcome Kit, in cents, from the Shopify products themselves (Victor, 20 Oct:
  one value everywhere, the total value of the free kit). The kit is the theme setting "Welcome Kit
  free products" (settings.welcome_kit_free_product): the products every subscription add puts in the
  cart (snippets/kc-plan-config.liquid, their first variant). A kit item is worth its variant's
  compare-at price, else its price, the same rule as the buybox kit tiles (assets/loop-widget.js).
  Shown by the end CTA (sections/featured-product.liquid), the sticky bar
  (snippets/sticky-cart-block.liquid) and the plans table kit popover
  (sections/product-compare-plans.liquid).

  Accepts:
  - product: {Product} one kit product (optional). Without it: the whole kit.

  Outputs the value in cents: of that product, or of every kit product together.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign kc_total = 0
  if product != blank
    assign kc_variant = product.variants.first
    assign kc_total = kc_variant.compare_at_price | default: kc_variant.price | default: 0
  else
    for kc_item in settings.welcome_kit_free_product
      assign kc_product = kc_item
      if kc_item.id == null
        assign kc_product = all_products[kc_item]
      endif
      if kc_product == blank or kc_product.variants.first == blank
        continue
      endif
      assign kc_variant = kc_product.variants.first
      assign kc_value = kc_variant.compare_at_price | default: kc_variant.price | default: 0
      assign kc_total = kc_total | plus: kc_value
    endfor
  endif
  echo kc_total
-%}
